You want the nonmetallic armor eventually, just because dragon mail is 
so superior. The only pieces of metallic armor even worth considering in 
the long run are the gauntlets of power and the shield of reflection 
(helm of brilliance doesn't count against you). Sounds like you don't 
need the shield, so you have to decide if the gauntlets are really worth 
it to you. They probably aren't.

I always play my archaeologists as spellcasters. But then, I play every 
class as a spellcaster. :)


